2025-03-08 Sebastian Zack Tin Lahm-Lee <bctnry@sdf.org>

	* v0.1.2
	+ `def` added shorthand for defining functions
	+ support for structs added; see manual.

2025-03-03 Sebastian Zack Tin Lahm-Lee <bctnry@sdf.org>

	* v0.1.1
	+ `strappend` is removed
	+ bug in `member` and `assoc` fixed.
	+ REPL support multiple line now.
	+ `bool` added to convert values into boolean values.
	+ `bool?` added to check if a value is boolean (i.e. `#t` or `#f`)
	+ together with `bool`, `and`, `or` and `not` now accepts a
	slightly different definition of "booleanish false": integer
	zero (*not* floating point zero), empty list and boolean false
	are now the only values that are considered "false-ish".
	+ `floatstr` and `intstr` added.


